Hi folks, I finally ascended someone wearing elvish armour.  After my
last
tourist got killed at the castle, it was a little while before I was
able
to try for an elvish armour ascention again.

I found a wand of wishing while on the quest and wished for a GDSM.
About
twenty seconds later I realised that I would get MR from my quest
artifact
and I could go for an elvish armour ascention.  I also found a
spellbook of
identify which was useful, but I needed to take off my mithril and
elven
shield to be able to cast it reliably.

Throughout the game I used 4 wishes for magic markers to improve my
armour.
I wanted to get my armour absolutely perfect, so I cursed genocided
disenchanters in sokoban, took off all my armour, wielded the piece of
armour that wasn't perfect and hit one of them once.  Then I'd go
downstairs, wear the armour and read a blessed scroll of enchant
armour.
If it didn't work I'd repeat the process.

